                "title": "Rope Leverset",
                "description": "The traditional and beautiful rope design of this solid brass Emtek made rose is carried up to accent the gentle curve of the lever. This leverset is available in a wide array of authentic finishes for a classic look. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. The Rope Lever with Matching Rope Rose is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions. \r\n",
